      "value": "people who want to doxx themself are one thing. but those who don't, don't want to. please give us another way. manual review, I don't care if it takes a month to get around to everyone. I don't care if I have to pay an extra 10 bucks for a 1 time thing INTERALLY for vrc to tick a box and be done with it.\n\nWhat I DO care about is identity fraud and doxxing myself.\n\nGive us a better way, Please.",
