  "details": "having to give persona full details on my id and face scans is fkn crazy, if all VRC wants is a dob then let me put some paper over the details they don't need to see. e.g; physical address, legal name, face. ect ect. and why would they even want face shots if they can tell if they have duplicate records of the same id.\n\ncompletely unnecessary and a clear issue when they pass that sht around like candy and KEEP HAVING LEAKS again, and again.\n\nProving they're not worth trusting to STORE it. using it is one thing. keeping it is another. \n\nI don't see why the attached image isn't able to be valid. date of birth, (expiry is even debatable), country, and a card/licence number. is More than enough.",
